note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note OM-1 TWIN of fold-trap.om (unroll and inline removed, om2 line made a note) for the pinned
note compiler 734f0a39: same expectations, cross-checking the oracle with OM-1 semantics now.
note Contract section 4 lines 102-104 and 105-108: an all-constant operation that would trap inside an
note unrolled or inlined body is not folded and stays the run-time trap with its OM-1 code; conversion
note range checks are kept. One stdin byte selects a case; values printed before the trap show order:
note   A 999, then unrolled div 100 i: trap 2 at i = 0                exit 102, stdout 999
note   B unrolled int add 2147483646 i: 2147483646 2147483647, trap 1  exit 101
note   C unrolled uchar add 254 i: 254 255, conversion trap 5         exit 105
note   D unrolled shl 1 add 62 i: 2^62 2^63, shift trap 7              exit 107
note   E unrolled int mul 1073741824 add i 1: 1073741824, trap 1      exit 101
note   F unrolled int div -2147483648 sub i 1: min / -1 at i = 0, trap 1   exit 101
note   G 999, then unrolled rem 7 i: trap 2 at i = 0                  exit 102, stdout 999
note   H inline cv 255, cv 256 (uchar a): 255, conversion trap 5      exit 105
note   I inline dv 100 4, dv 100 0 (div a b): 25, trap 2               exit 102
note ps v prints v, or 7777 for a negative v (only a wrongly folded, wrapped value is negative).
note Twin fold-trap-rolled.om (unroll and inline removed) has the same expectations:
note oracle/s3s4/exp/fold-trap-*.out (python3, oracle/s3s4/oracle.py).
note OM-1 unit: this line replaces the om2 line
fn cv a ulong to uchar
ret uchar a
end
fn dv a ulong b ulong to ulong
ret div a b
end
fn ps v int to void
if lt v 0
pu 7777
else
pu ulong v
end
end
fn main to int
s = new uchar 1 0
r = read 0 s 0 1
k = get s 0
if eq k 65
pu 999
for i ulong 4
pu div 100 i
end
end
if eq k 66
for i int 4
ps add 2147483646 i
end
end
if eq k 67
for i ulong 4
pu ulong uchar add 254 i
end
end
if eq k 68
for i ulong 4
pu shl 1 add 62 i
end
end
if eq k 69
for i int 4
ps mul 1073741824 add i 1
end
end
if eq k 70
for i int 4
ps add 5 div -2147483648 sub i 1
end
end
if eq k 71
pu 999
for i ulong 4
pu rem 7 i
end
end
if eq k 72
pu ulong cv 255
pu ulong cv 256
end
if eq k 73
pu dv 100 4
pu dv 100 0
end
ret 0
end
